      "note": "looks good",
      "kind": "observation",
      "anchor": {
        "quote": "The general return period for items purchased on Cartwheel starts from the delivery date and lasts for 30 days. This means you have 30 days to return an item after it has been delivered, provided it is in the condition described by the store's listing. \n\nFor more details, you can refer to the Cartwheel return policy (policy ID: cw-returns)."
      },
      "author": "human",
      "created_at": "2026-11-14T04:50:12.275889+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-11-14T04:50:12.276745+00:00"
    }
  },
  {
    "action": "edit",
    "at": "2026-11-15T16:03:01.813981+00:00",
    "previous": {
      "id": "34942719-0395-44e2-ad76-b27867f04a82",
      "trace_id": "0a9cb2002b18dca933c7f960116d26d3",
      "note": "looks good",
      "kind": "observation",
      "anchor": {
        "quote": "According to the Cartwheel refund policy (policy ID: cw-refunds), approved refunds are processed back to the original payment method and typically arrive within 5 to 10 business days. If the refund is for $100 or less, it should execute automatically once the order passes the eligibility check. For refunds over $100, they require additional review by a human support agent.\n\nIf you need more detailed information or assistance, just let me know!"
      },
      "author": "human",
      "created_at": "2026-11-14T04:50:29.558541+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-11-14T04:50:29.558550+00:00"
    }
  },
  {
