      "trace_id": "99335b972c22988662cde0458672f9cc",
      "note": "looks good",
      "kind": "observation",
      "anchor": {
        "quote": "According to the Cartwheel shipping policy (policy id: cw-shipping), stores typically ship orders within **3 days** of purchase. After the order is shipped, standard delivery takes up to **7 days** in transit.\n\nIf you have any further questions about shipping or anything else, feel free to ask!"
      },
